EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
The Sweetgrass Planned Unit Development (PUD) Final Plan was adopted by the City Council by
Ordinance No. 4232 on June 11, 2018. Since that time, the Applicant has recorded a Sweetgrass
Subdivision 1 Filing consisting of the following elements:
•
Residential lots including 90 single-family, detached home lots and a single 7.67-acre lot
which could accommodate apartment buildings, perhaps student housing;
•
The northern portion of the subdivision, the Village Center, provides lots of varying sizes
for retail, hotel, a fire station, a police station, a library and a church. The plat shows 13
non-residential lots in this Village Center along with 2 lots for access and utility easements.
