1.
The application meets all threshold requirements for application of the PUD
District or Form-based Code standards.
Complies.The threshold requirements for application of a PUD District are found in Section 5.6.2
of the UDC and include the following: (1) A minimum size of 2 acres; (2) a Sketch Plan detailing
the Applicant’s intent; and (3) a Preliminary Plan containing concepts, standards and phasing for
the full build-out of the subject property.
Those requirements were met by the PUD Preliminary Plan (UDC-16-00509) and by the 2018 PUD
Final Plan (UDC-18-00105). This first amendment continues to meet those thresholds.
2.
The application presents clear and specific criteria on how the property and
subsequentdevelopment will be reviewed, regulated and modified consistent
with these regulations.
