a.
Intent: Sweetgrass is intended to have an open feeling, borrowing heavily from surrounding
open lands. An open style of fencing along open space areas contributes to this feeling.
b.
Open rail wood fences, or metal picket fences may occur, and are not required, along College
Drive, Avenue C, High Plains Road, Collector Streets, and the golf course. Any change in fence
type (e.g., metal picket to open rail) shall occur at a masonry column.
