a.
Intent: The intent of the Golf Course Clubhouse District is to allow the development of an upscale
resort and convention center focused on the golf course, tennis facilities, swimming pool, stables,
and/or equestrian facilities. Guest facilities may be stand-alone suites or attached villas, within a
traditional hotel, or a combination thereof. The tennis club and/or equestrian arena may include
stadium seating. Portions of the site may host outside events, such as weddings, parties, and other
gatherings. Clubhouses will include food and beverage service, as well as locker rooms, swimming
pool(s), golf cart storage and maintenance, and other uses commonly found in such. A portion of
the Parcel may be developed as High Density Residential, depending upon market conditions.
